  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 11.3% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.91B (11.3% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/09/18/cftc-sends-crypto-rules-to-white-house-to-review-as-congress-stalls-on-clarity-act\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFTC sends crypto rules to White House to review as Congress stalls on Clarity Act</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/the-amc-fight-turned-into-an-industry-argument-over-which-tokenized-stock-model-wins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The AMC Fight Turned Into An Industry Argument Over Which Tokenized Stock Model Wins</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-moonpay-team-up-to-expand-us-access-to-tokenized-money-market-fund?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WisdomTree, MoonPay team up to expand US access to tokenized money market fund</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOVm8tbUpoalI5Mnd6RHNveG1EaGNIYXBzOFAwZnIxZ05YX1gtNkVDX3FVaVUtdXZmLWJyV2wwZWI1aVFZUTJQSXFKZTVpd2FScTNhVndLZUY1blo3RDJCM1hIRUNsUXd3N1ctbHlLcUhaM293NVdIc0RaTEdNd1NQTFdGVXJhZFZjbW1NeWEwclE2X3lYcDA3SGdJNTZJTWMyYjMzcTBTcXkzMFZSaVhIUk1qalQxeGxodmtlZjQwQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC rolls out &#x27;innovation exemption&#x27; for tokenized securities trading venues</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
